{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786659656555542001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"decagonal-indisposed-tamarin","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":1,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"eae2950670019107411afc9cbe9f6cea46ea07e53e28c2d660ebb97176af6e79","event_uuid":"f0d64690-ed16-42d3-bb8e-1ed17a1f2d0e","position":{"commit_sha":"02690a79091b2f15d7079ccedcc925760baa6da7","position":"1786598942661292001-f0d64690-ed16-42d3-bb8e-1ed17a1f2d0e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786598942661292001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context\nTwo accepted reliability oracles still consume multi-second wall time per matrix cell: test_slow_but_progressing_remote_is_not_aborted deliberately serves for 15 seconds (15.1s in current macOS CI; original behavior ticket suave-constant-cow), and test_read_retried_then_terminal uses one-second timeout/grace/drain windows across retries (9.06s; original behavior ticket fizzy-trunk-salt). Their real process/socket coverage is load-bearing, but the production-scale durations are not.\n\n## Plan\nRetain one real socket/process-group sentinel for each mechanism while injecting smaller test-only stall, timeout, grace, and drain windows with generous scheduling headroom. Keep semantic attempt/reap/throughput assertions and use polling rather than brittle absolute-time pass conditions.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Slow-progress still crosses a full configured low-speed window and proves throughput, not elapsed wall time, prevents abort.\n- [ ] ACLI read still spawns exactly the production retry count and proves every process group is reaped.\n- [ ] Production timeout/stall defaults are unchanged.\n- [ ] The focused tests retain real subprocess/socket execution but complete in low single-digit seconds on macOS CI.\n- [ ] No absolute upper-bound assertion is tightened into a loaded-runner flake.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ci","performance","tests","reliability"],"ticket_id":"baeb-4f4b-3227-457e","ticket_type":"task","title":"Shrink test-only real-time windows in subprocess and network sentinels","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f0d64690-ed16-42d3-bb8e-1ed17a1f2d0e"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659656555542001,"uuid":"1e5a40eb-f5d1-4283-8748-18b600c670f0"}